{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u7ewgEWAZA1794469980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國泰航空有由日本返港航班因技術原因，需轉飛其他機場。</p><p></p><p>昨日由東京成田機場返港的CX521航班，同樣因技術原因，要中途轉飛大阪關西國際機場，並安排乘客轉乘另一航班返港。</p><p></p><p>國泰指工程團隊，會仔細檢查及維修涉事飛機。</p><p></p><p>國泰航空回覆查詢時亦指，周二由倫敦希斯羅機場返港，編號CX252的航班，起飛後返回希斯羅機場，據悉懷疑曾撞到雀鳥。國泰指已安排乘客轉乘其他航班返港。</p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:44:05.920975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:28.150361+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:28.150361+00:00","content_hash":"b6ffb5f09ab6e17d1d63b2ca0e1e55bd8a6fb63d474f8f9b59085480f7e6d90b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}